## Model card (verified spec facts only)

- **Name:** GPT 5.3 Codex Spark
- **Short description:** A lightweight Spark-tier variant of GPT-5.3 Codex designed for fast, efficient agentic coding workloads (CloudPrice description). Sibling of `gpt-5.3-codex`, not an alias.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `opencode/gpt-5.3-codex-spark` via `https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/responses`; OpenAI API (`gpt-5.3-codex-spark`, also listed as `chatgpt/gpt-5.3-codex-spark`).
- **Release / knowledge:** Release date not published in tracked sources (CloudPrice `release_date: null`; family is the GPT-5.3 generation, Feb 2026). Knowledge cutoff: no verified public data found.
- **IDs:** `opencode/gpt-5.3-codex-spark` (Zen); `gpt-5.3-codex-spark` (OpenAI)
- **Context window:** 128K tokens (CloudPrice API; max output: no verified public number found). NOTE: Zen prices it in the ≤272K tier band alongside GPT-5.3 Codex.
- **Modalities:** Text (and image per CloudPrice input flag) in, text out; function calling yes; parallel function calling yes; structured outputs yes; reasoning: CloudPrice flags `reasoning: false` (Spark-tier speed focus) — conflicting with its Codex-line reasoning positioning, no verified data
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-01):** Zen paid — $1.75 / 1M input, $14.00 / 1M output, cache read $0.175 (identical to GPT-5.3 Codex on Zen). No first-party per-token price verified (CloudPrice: no pricing tracked, 0 providers).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary (OpenAI); lightweight Spark-tier variant of GPT-5.3 Codex; parameter count not disclosed.

